  title: Ten Percent
  concept: Reliability and redundancy in series systems
  nasaSource: NASA Systems Engineering Handbook (NASA/SP-2016-6105)
  body: If every subsystem must work, the success chances multiply. Spare copies
    (redundancy) raise each subsystem's chance of working at the cost of mass. Reliability
    numbers in this game are game-balance values, not NASA data.
